[38.088185, "o", "name: rust-tokio-util\r\nversion: 0.7.18-1\r\nsummary: Additional utilities for working with Tokio - Rust source code\r\nmaintainer: Debian Rust Maintainers <pkg-rust-maintainers@alioth-lists.debian.net>\r\nsection: rust\r\ncontact: Debian Rust Maintainers <pkg-rust-maintainers@alioth-lists.debian.net>\r\nsource-code: https://tokio.rs\r\nvcs-git: https://github.com/tokio-rs/tokio\r\nlicense: MIT\r\nissues: https://github.com/tokio-rs/tokio/issues\r\ncustom-source-fields:\r\n  X-Cargo-Crate: tokio-util\r\n  X-Cargo-Crate-Version: 0.7.18\r\nparts:\r\n  check:\r\n    plugin: cargo\r\n    source: .\r\n    build-packages-arch:\r\n    - cargo:native\r\n    - rustc:native (>= 1.71)\r\n    - libstd-rust-dev\r\n    - package: librust-bytes-1+default-dev (>= 1.5.0)\r\n      profiles:\r\n      - nocheck\r\n    - package: librust-futures-core-0.3+default-dev\r\n      profiles:\r\n      - nocheck\r\n    - package: librust-futures-sink-0.3+default-dev\r\n      profiles:\r\n      - nocheck\r\n    - package: librust-pin-project-lite-0.2+default-dev (>= 0.2.11)\r\n      profiles:\r\n      - nocheck\r\n    - package: librust-tokio-1+default-dev (>= 1.44.0)\r\n      profiles:\r\n      - nocheck\r\n    - package: librust-tokio-1+sync-dev (>= 1.44.0)\r\n      profiles:\r\n      - nocheck\r\n    after:\r\n    - crate\r\n  crate:\r\n    plugin: dump\r\n    source: .\r\npackages:\r\n  librust-tokio-util+full-dev:\r\n    architectures: any\r\n    summary: Additional utilities for working with Tokio - feature \"full\"\r\n    description: This metapackage enables feature \"full\" for the Rust tokio-util crate, by pulling in any additional dependencies needed by that feature.\r\n    depends:\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util+codec-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util+compat-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util+io-util-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util+time-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util+net-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util+rt-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util+join-map-dev\r\n    provides:\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-0+full-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-0.7+full-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-0.7.18+full-dev\r\n    breaks:\r\n    - rustc (<< 1.71~)\r\n    multi-arch: same\r\n  librust-tokio-util+futures-io-dev:\r\n    architectures: any\r\n    summary: Additional utilities for working with Tokio - feature \"futures-io\" and 1 more\r\n    description: |-\r\n      This metapackage enables feature \"futures-io\" for the Rust tokio-util crate, by pulling in any additional dependencies needed by that feature.\r\n\r\n      Additionally, this package also provides the \"compat\" feature.\r\n    depends:\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-dev\r\n    - librust-futures-io-0.3+default-dev\r\n    provides:\r\n    - librust-tokio-util+compat-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-0+futures-io-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-0+compat-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-0.7+futures-io-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-0.7+compat-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-0.7.18+futures-io-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-0.7.18+compat-dev\r\n    breaks:\r\n    - rustc (<< 1.71~)\r\n    multi-arch: same\r\n  librust-tokio-util+futures-util-dev:\r\n    architectures: any\r\n    summary: Additional utilities for working with Tokio - feature \"futures-util\" and 1 more\r\n    description: |-\r\n      This metapackage enables feature \"futures-util\" for the Rust tokio-util crate, by pulling in any additional dependencies needed by that feature.\r\n\r\n      Additionally, this package also provides the \"__docs_rs\" feature.\r\n    depends:\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-dev\r\n    - librust-futures-util-0.3+default-dev\r\n    provides:\r\n    - librust-tokio-util+--docs-rs-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-0+futures-util-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-0+--docs-rs-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-0.7+futures-util-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-0.7+--docs-rs-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-0.7.18+futures-util-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-0.7.18+--docs-rs-dev\r\n    breaks:\r\n    - rustc (<< 1.71~)\r\n    multi-arch: same\r\n  librust-tokio-util+hashbrown-dev:\r\n    architectures: any\r\n    summary: Additional utilities for working with Tokio - feature \"hashbrown\"\r\n    description: This metapackage enables feature \"hashbrown\" for the Rust tokio-util crate, by pulling in any additional dependencies needed by that feature.\r\n    depends:\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-dev\r\n    - librust-hashbrown-0.15-dev\r\n    provides:\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-0+hashbrown-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-0.7+hashbrown-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-0.7.18+hashbrown-dev\r\n    breaks:\r\n    - rustc (<< 1.71~)\r\n    multi-arch: same\r\n  librust-tokio-util+io-util-dev:\r\n    architectures: any\r\n    summary: Additional utilities for working with Tokio - feature \"io-util\"\r\n    description: This metapackage enables feature \"io-util\" for the Rust tokio-util crate, by pulling in any additional dependencies needed by that feature.\r\n    depends:\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util+io-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-1+io-util-dev (>= 1.44.0)\r\n    - librust-tokio-1+rt-dev (>= 1.44.0)\r\n    - librust-tokio-1+sync-dev (>= 1.44.0)\r\n    provides:\r\n"]
[38.088477499999996, "o", "    - librust-tokio-util-0+io-util-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-0.7+io-util-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-0.7.18+io-util-dev\r\n    breaks:\r\n    - rustc (<< 1.71~)\r\n    multi-arch: same\r\n  librust-tokio-util+join-map-dev:\r\n    architectures: any\r\n    summary: Additional utilities for working with Tokio - feature \"join-map\"\r\n    description: This metapackage enables feature \"join-map\" for the Rust tokio-util crate, by pulling in any additional dependencies needed by that feature.\r\n    depends:\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util+rt-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util+hashbrown-dev\r\n    provides:\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-0+join-map-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-0.7+join-map-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-0.7.18+join-map-dev\r\n    breaks:\r\n    - rustc (<< 1.71~)\r\n    multi-arch: same\r\n  librust-tokio-util+net-dev:\r\n    architectures: any\r\n    summary: Additional utilities for working with Tokio - feature \"net\"\r\n    description: This metapackage enables feature \"net\" for the Rust tokio-util crate, by pulling in any additional dependencies needed by that feature.\r\n    depends:\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-1+net-dev (>= 1.44.0)\r\n    - librust-tokio-1+sync-dev (>= 1.44.0)\r\n    provides:\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-0+net-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-0.7+net-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-0.7.18+net-dev\r\n    breaks:\r\n    - rustc (<< 1.71~)\r\n    multi-arch: same\r\n  librust-tokio-util+rt-dev:\r\n    architectures: any\r\n    summary: Additional utilities for working with Tokio - feature \"rt\"\r\n    description: This metapackage enables feature \"rt\" for the Rust tokio-util crate, by pulling in any additional dependencies needed by that feature.\r\n    depends:\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util+futures-util-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-1+rt-dev (>= 1.44.0)\r\n    - librust-tokio-1+sync-dev (>= 1.44.0)\r\n    provides:\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-0+rt-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-0.7+rt-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-0.7.18+rt-dev\r\n    breaks:\r\n    - rustc (<< 1.71~)\r\n    multi-arch: same\r\n  librust-tokio-util+slab-dev:\r\n    architectures: any\r\n    summary: Additional utilities for working with Tokio - feature \"slab\"\r\n    description: This metapackage enables feature \"slab\" for the Rust tokio-util crate, by pulling in any additional dependencies needed by that feature.\r\n    depends:\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-dev\r\n    - librust-slab-0.4+default-dev (>= 0.4.4)\r\n    provides:\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-0+slab-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-0.7+slab-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-0.7.18+slab-dev\r\n    breaks:\r\n    - rustc (<< 1.71~)\r\n    multi-arch: same\r\n  librust-tokio-util+time-dev:\r\n    architectures: any\r\n    summary: Additional utilities for working with Tokio - feature \"time\"\r\n    description: This metapackage enables feature \"time\" for the Rust tokio-util crate, by pulling in any additional dependencies needed by that feature.\r\n    depends:\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util+slab-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-1+sync-dev (>= 1.44.0)\r\n    - librust-tokio-1+time-dev (>= 1.44.0)\r\n    provides:\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-0+time-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-0.7+time-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-0.7.18+time-dev\r\n    breaks:\r\n    - rustc (<< 1.71~)\r\n    multi-arch: same\r\n  librust-tokio-util+tracing-dev:\r\n    architectures: any\r\n    summary: Additional utilities for working with Tokio - feature \"tracing\"\r\n    description: This metapackage enables feature \"tracing\" for the Rust tokio-util crate, by pulling in any additional dependencies needed by that feature.\r\n    depends:\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-dev\r\n    - librust-tracing-0.1+std-dev (>= 0.1.29)\r\n    provides:\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-0+tracing-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-0.7+tracing-dev\r\n    - librust-tokio-util-0.7.18+tracing-dev\r\n    breaks:\r\n    - rustc (<< 1.71~)\r\n    multi-arch: same\r\n  librust-tokio-util-dev:\r\n    architectures: any\r\n    summary: Additional utilities for working with Tokio - Rust source code\r\n    description: Source code for Debianized Rust crate \"tokio-util\"\r\n    depends:\r\n    - librust-bytes-1+default-dev (>"]
